{"id":"94c497a695780952","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-indiscernibles.md","title":"Silver Indiscernibles","display":"thm-indiscernibles — Silver Indiscernibles","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-indiscernibles","aliases":["58-thm-indiscernibles"],"display":"thm-indiscernibles — Silver Indiscernibles","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-silver-indiscernible.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-indiscernibles"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-indiscernibles</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-indiscernibles — Silver Indiscernibles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"16b215b0ea9d456b\" href=\"?note=16b215b0ea9d456b\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md\">../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ab4158d0f08e490\" href=\"?note=9ab4158d0f08e490\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-silver-indiscernible.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-silver-indiscernible.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\">\\(\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\)</span> (zero-sharp existence statement)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (constructible universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (a metalinguistically quantified proper class of ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (the ordinal class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PropClass}_S\\)</span> (proper-class predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_S(I)\">\\(\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_S(I)\\)</span> (Silver-indiscernible class predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernibles}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\n\\to\n\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}} I\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(I)\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_S(I)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernibles}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\n\\to\n\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}} I\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(I)\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_S(I)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantifier over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is a class quantifier: no set can be unbounded in the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is special to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> under the strong hypothesis that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^\\sharp\">\\(0^\\sharp\\)</span> exists; an arbitrary model with some indiscernibles need not have a club proper class of them.</li>\n<li>The class quantifier is explicit, and the formula/assignment semantics are delegated to the registered Silver-indiscernible predicate instead of applying set satisfaction directly to the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md","status":"resolved","id":"16b215b0ea9d456b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-silver-indiscernible.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ab4158d0f08e490","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-silver-indiscernible.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_S(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernibles}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\n\\to\n\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}} I\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(I)\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_S(I)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"0^\\sharp","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1601,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-indiscernibles.md|58-thm-indiscernibles]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["16b215b0ea9d456b","de47935b5769dd1e","5582a281f15a33c2","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","9ab4158d0f08e490"]}